 "source_instruction": "i'm looking for coaxial cable for video accessories it can intall at any",
 "query": "Ugh, I swear my neighbor\u2019s tabby cat keeps sneaking onto my back porch to knock over my potted mint plant, I had to move all my herb planters up to the second-floor railing yesterday just to keep it from digging in the soil. Oh, and my bike chain slipped on my ride to the corner store this morning too, I got grease all over my favorite canvas tote and had to scrub it for ten minutes in the grocery store bathroom before I could even grab my groceries. I stopped to chat with the barista at the coffee shop down the block for a bit after that, they said they\u2019re rolling out a new honey lavender latte next week and gave me a tiny sample cup that was actually way sweeter than I expected. Anyway, I\u2019m looking in the satellite TV section for a coaxial cable, specifically the 3GHz dual W with ground in black, and I don\u2019t want to go over that one for the price.",
